    <item>
      <title>Part 3: Residence Card</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/residence-card/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 15 Feb 2026 15:10:21 -0500</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/residence-card/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Spouse Visa and Residence Card Part 3: Your Residence Card
    &lt;div id=&#34;spouse-visa-and-residence-card-part-3-your-residence-card&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#spouse-visa-and-residence-card-part-3-your-residence-card&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img
    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;
    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
    decoding=&#34;async&#34;
    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;
    alt=&#34;Residence Card&#34;
    width=&#34;4080&#34;
    height=&#34;3072&#34;
    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/residence_card_hu_cd27393dabb2a7ca.jpg&#34;
    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/residence_card_hu_cd27393dabb2a7ca.jpg 800w, http://localhost:1313/residence_card_hu_6bcff41cc6a35614.jpg 1280w&#34;
    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;
    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/residence_card.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;Proud owner of a Residence Card&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I recently flew to Japan to pick up my residence card (在留カード).It was short trip as I had to come back to the US to finalize some last minute things (sale of our home, cars, work, etc). This return is very temporary as I will return to Japan full time in the upcoming weeks. Anyhow, I am fully over my jetlag and I am able to continue posting. So let&amp;rsquo;s jump into Part 3: Residence Card!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
